* DIY Vactrol Model: Green LED + GL5516 CdS Photoresistor
* Calibrated from bench measurement data (56uA to 15.2mA)
* Pins:
*   A   = LED Anode
*   K   = LED Cathode
*   R1  = Photoresistor Terminal 1
*   R2  = Photoresistor Terminal 2

.subckt DIY_VACTROL A K R1 R2
* -------------------------------------------------------------
* 1. Green LED Stage (Calibrated to 2.49V @ 2mA, 2.565V @ 3.06mA)
* -------------------------------------------------------------
D_LED A N_sense D_GREEN
Vsense N_sense K 0V
.model D_GREEN D(Is=1.25e-13 N=4.0 Rs=30 Bv=5 Ibv=10u)

* Input-to-output parasitic coupling capacitance
C_iso A R1 0.8p

* -------------------------------------------------------------
* 2. Current Sensing & Multi-Pole Dynamic Filter
* -------------------------------------------------------------
B_raw raw 0 V = max(0, I(Vsense))

* Primary asymmetric response (Ton = 20ms, Toff = 100ms)
G_lag 0 lag1 VALUE = { if(V(raw) > V(lag1), (V(raw) - V(lag1)) / Ton, (V(raw) - V(lag1)) / Toff) }
C_lag lag1 0 1 IC=0
R_bleed lag1 0 1G

* Secondary high-frequency CdS diffusion pole (suppresses 2*f0 ripple)
R_pole lag1 lag 10k
C_pole lag 0 20n

* -------------------------------------------------------------
* 3. Photoresistor Transfer Characteristic
* -------------------------------------------------------------
* Evaluates R(I) using mA scaling: R = 190 + 183.3/I_mA + 325.7/sqrt(I_mA)
* Clamped between Rmin (190 ohms) and Rdark (1.5 Meg)
R_cell R1 R2 R = limit( Rmin + (183.3 / max(1u, V(lag)*1k)) + (325.7 / sqrt(max(1u, V(lag)*1k))), Rmin, Rdark )
C_cell R1 R2 4p

* Model parameters
.param Ton=20m Toff=100m Rmin=190 Rdark=1.5Meg
.ends DIY_VACTROL
